<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86607" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προαπ-αλλάσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προάπ-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>remove beforehand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ ἐκ τῆς δημαρχίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					44.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παῖδας φαρμάκῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					37.13
				</span></i>
			; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ σφυγμὸς] π. τὴν σφοδρότητα</span>
			<i>loses</i> its energy, <i><span class="en">
				Marcellin.
				<u>Puls.</u>
				257
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>depart</i> or <i>die beforehand,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				43.11
			</span></i>: also intr. in 
				Act.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. εἰς τὴν οἰκείαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					18.15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προαπαλλάξας</span>”
				<i>having predeceased,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Acad.Ind.</u>
					p.83
				</span></i>
			 M.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
